      "difficulty_level": "H2",
      "difficulty_reason": "The author translates Solomon-Mackey multiplication into composition-refinement subsequence coefficients, preserves multiplicities of equal subsequences at distinct positions, cancels their alternating sums, and sums the integer-component actions to obtain the full factorized q-coefficient matrix on the descent B-basis. Integer components and q-specialization are one operator-action object. Rank and idempotent specializations do not determine this complete action and are not separately counted.",
